Z||000000||1FieroGTRacingInc||03-31-2000||03:15 AM||||I have installed 4 the last month.. EVERYTIME it bends the top housing of the thermo. and allow's my thermo. to move and let coolant cycle ALL the time. I do know that this is NOT GOOD  for my motor at all. <P>My Question is what do I do?? How do I keep my thermo down flat??  lol super glue??  No really I need help... Thank you.<BR>                              1FGTRInc.||||reg||1
Z||000001||FIEROCIOUS||03-31-2000||03:19 AM||||I had the same problem with (2) 160 degree stats but have never had a problem with the stock thermostats! What gives? I don't know!||||reg||1
